stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Browsing
    Browsing --> Pending: Text or type filter changes
    Results --> Pending: Edit query
    Empty --> Pending: Edit query
    Pending --> Results: Parse types and queries / score matches
    Pending --> Empty: No matches / clear selection
    Pending --> Browsing: Clear query
    Pending --> Results: Navigation or activation flushes pending input
    Results --> Results: Arrows choose a spatial match
    Results --> Results: Tab / Shift+Tab cycle ranked matches
    Results --> Results: Shortcut grid chooses a matching neighbor
    Results --> Launch: Enter activates selection
    Empty --> Empty: Navigation / Enter do nothing
    Browsing --> Browsing: Arrows explore all nodes / Tab explores links
    note right of Results
        steam >app equals >app steam.
        >app|roam steam includes either type.
        >app steam >roam notes uses independent queries.
        Dimmed context nodes are outside keyboard results.
    end note
